  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Subject: Angry Feedback for studioName Studio


    Dear incompetents
    at studioName Studio,


    I can''t believe the lack of talent you have been
    showing in your games. It''s astounding how you manage to release title after
    title that is so terrible. You should be ashamed of wasting time and resources
    on what you do.


    Your stories are bland, your mechanics are pathetic, and
    your graphics are a disgrace. Why do you continue to create this garbage? It''s
    a complete waste of space in the gaming market.


    I hope you abandon this
    endeavor altogether and leave the gaming industry to real professionals. You
    are a joke and should be treated as such.


    With contempt,


    anonymous62

    anonymous@inmail.com'
